// The rollback in the editor (§13.1 ): inside the draft - by pictures of the typed text (word -
// one step); the adopted edit (draft closed) - by editing back: the elements are the same, the
// text of the unit - as before the editing; repetition - the same (*my*: history - edits,
// journal is not rewritten). The element changed after the edit - rejection.
// program: editor_text.vish
open_view module
pointer 1 @привет 0 7
key 1 x
key 1 y
key 1 \s
key 1 z
// expect: курсор:   s = "приветxy z‸, мир";
// inside the draft: word - step, space - step
key 1 z 2
// expect: курсор:   s = "приветxy ‸, мир";
key 1 z 2
key 1 z 2
// expect: курсор:   s = "привет‸, мир";
// drafting
key 1 y 2
// expect: курсор:   s = "приветxy‸, мир";
// Adopted edit: canon, then rollback - text until edited
key 1 Escape
// expect: s = "приветxy, мир";
key 1 z 2
// expect: s = "привет, мир";
// expect-not: приветxy
// expect: курсор:   s = "привет‸, мир";
run
// expect: output text="привет, мир\n" ok=true
// repeat
key 1 y 2
// expect: s = "приветxy, мир";
run
// expect: output text="приветxy, мир\n" ok=true
// After a new edit, there is nothing to repeat.
pointer 1 @print 0 0
key 1 p
key 1 Escape
key 1 y 2
// expect: повторять нечего
// rollback
key 1 z 2
// expect: курсор:   p‸rint(s);
key 1 z 2
// expect: s = "привет, мир";
key 1 z 2
// expect: откатывать нечего
roundtrip
// expect: roundtrip: совпадает
